# The motor picker's sources: the bundled ThrustCurve.org catalogue, a live ThrustCurve.org search, and a picked download
# (needs the network; keep the download cache out of ~/.config with BOWSHOCK_MOTORS_DIR):
#   BOWSHOCK_MOTORS_DIR=/tmp/bowshock-tc cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/thrustcurve-picker.drive out/tc
# Offline state: add BOWSHOCK_THRUSTCURVE_API=http://127.0.0.1:9 (nothing listens there); the search shows "ThrustCurve
# unreachable" and the catalogue keeps working.
viewport 1280x800
click (78, 782)
click "New configuration…"
screenshot tc-catalogue.png
click "ThrustCurve.org"
click #motor-search
type "H128"
screenshot tc-search.png
click "In catalogue"
screenshot tc-picked.png
